{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25378","headline":"郊坛回舆中书二相公蒙圣慈召至御马前仰感恩遇辄书是诗兼呈二相公 · 李德裕","name":"郊坛回舆中书二相公蒙圣慈召至御马前仰感恩遇辄书是诗兼呈二相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七萃和銮动，三条葆吹回。\n相星环日道，苍马近龙媒。\n咫尺天颜接，光华喜气来。\n自慙衰且病，无以效涓埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}